                    78.0,
                    375.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The administrator with a sense for style hates waste; the engineer with a sense for style economizes his material; the artisan with a sense for style prefers good work. Style is the ultimate morality of mind.",
